[{"location":"","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"CurrentModule = PolynomialEnsembles","category":"page"},{"location":"#PolynomialEnsembles","page":"Home","title":"PolynomialEnsembles","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"Documentation for PolynomialEnsembles.","category":"page"},{"location":"","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"","category":"page"},{"location":"","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"Modules = [PolynomialEnsembles]","category":"page"},{"location":"#PolynomialEnsembles.grad_pfq","page":"Home","title":"PolynomialEnsembles.grad_pfq","text":"grad_pFq_impl(pfq_val, a, b, z, precision = 1.0e-14, max_steps = 10^6; prec)\n\nReturns the gradient of the generalized hypergeometric function wrt to the input arguments:\n\n$\n\n_pF_q(a_1,...,a_p;b_1,...,b_q;z)\n\n$\n\nWhere: $     \\frac{\\partial }{\\partial a1} =      \\sum{k=1}^{\\infty}{        \\frac          {\\left(1 + \\sum{m=0}^{k-1}\\frac{1}{m+a1}\\right)            * \\left(\\prod{j=1}^p\\left(aj\\right)k\\right)z^k}          {k!\\prod{j=1}^q\\left(bj\\right)k}}        - {}pFq(a1,...,ap;b1,...,bq;z) $ $     \\frac{\\partial }{\\partial b1} =      {}pFq(a1,...,ap;b1,...,bq;z) -      \\sum{k=1}^{\\infty}{        \\frac          {\\left(1 + \\sum{m=0}^{k-1}\\frac{1}{m+b1}\\right)            * \\left(\\prod{j=1}^p\\left(aj\\right)k\\right)z^k}          {k!\\prod{j=1}^q\\left(bj\\right)k}} $\n\n$\n\n\\frac{\\partial }{\\partial z} =\n\\frac{\\prod_{j=1}^{p}(a_j)}{\\prod_{j=1}^{q} (b_j)}\\\n{}_pF_q(a_1+1,...,a_p+1;b_1+1,...,b_q+1;z)\n\n$\n\nNoting the the recurrence relation for the digamma function: psi(x + 1) = psi(x) + frac1x, the gradients for the function with respect to a and b then simplify to:\n\n$\n\n\\frac{\\partial }{\\partial a_1} =\n \\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}{\n   \\frac\n     {\\left(1 + \\sum_{m=0}^{k-1}\\frac{1}{m+a_1}\\right)\n       * \\left(\\prod_{j=1}^p\\left(a_j\\right)_k\\right)z^k}\n     {k!\\prod_{j=1}^q\\left(b_j\\right)_k}}\n   - {}_pF_q(a_1,...,a_p;b_1,...,b_q;z)\n\n$\n\n$\n\n\\frac{\\partial }{\\partial b_1} =\n {}_pF_q(a_1,...,a_p;b_1,...,b_q;z) -\n \\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}{\n   \\frac\n     {\\left(1 + \\sum_{m=0}^{k-1}\\frac{1}{m+b_1}\\right)\n       * \\left(\\prod_{j=1}^p\\left(a_j\\right)_k\\right)z^k}\n     {k!\\prod_{j=1}^q\\left(b_j\\right)_k}}\n\n$\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"}]
